OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see a few passing showers. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be rather
OL,8,Fcloudy with showers, but these
OL,9,Fbecoming fewer later on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA rather cloudy day with a
OL,12,Ffew passing showers but some spells of
OL,13,Fdry weather too.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA few
OL,16,Fshowers at first on Sunday, otherwise
OL,17,Fbecoming dry. Mainly dry on Monday,
OL,18,Fcloudier with some rain on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
